@startuml
title Checkout Saga with Compensation
actor Customer
participant "Nuxt Frontend" as Frontend
participant "SokoHub API" as Api
participant "Checkout Saga" as Saga
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Orders" as Orders
participant "Payments" as Payments
database "MSSQL" as Store
participant "RabbitMQ" as Broker
participant "Workers" as Workers

Customer -> Frontend: place order
Frontend -> Api: POST /api/checkout
Api -> Saga: start saga
Saga -> Inventory: reserve items
Inventory -> Store: create InventoryReservation
Inventory --> Saga: InventoryReserved
Saga -> Orders: create vendor orders
Orders -> Store: persist order split
Orders --> Saga: orders created
Saga -> Payments: initiate payment
Payments --> Saga: payment intent
Saga -> Api: checkout result
Api --> Frontend: checkout response

== Success path ==
Payments -> Broker: PaymentSucceeded
Broker -> Workers: consume payment event
Workers -> Inventory: consume reservations
Inventory -> Store: decrease on-hand
Workers -> Orders: confirm order
Orders -> Broker: OrderConfirmed
Broker -> Notifications: notify customer

== Failure / compensation ==
Payments -> Broker: PaymentFailed
Broker -> Workers: consume failure event
Workers -> Saga: compensate
Saga -> Inventory: release reservations
Inventory -> Store: mark reservations released
Inventory -> Store: increase available stock
Saga -> Orders: cancel vendor orders
Orders -> Store: mark order cancelled
Orders -> Broker: OrderCancelled
Broker -> Notifications: notify customer
Saga --> Api: saga complete
@enduml